Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies"]],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"project","variants":[{"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[{"projectFiles":"OUDS-Discovery-Tutorial.zip","backgroundImage":"ic_unified_ds.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several librairies for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"These librairies help to split products and make users able to select only what they need.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"hero","title":"Swift Package integration","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"image":"ic_unified_ds.png","chapter":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its librairies","xcodeRequirement":"Xcode 26.5"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"title":"Import the Swift Package and the libraries","anchor":"Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS for iOS is an open source Swift Package available on GitHub under MIT license.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"The package and the librairies must be added through Xcode.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"stepsSection":[{"code":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-1-ouds-swift-package.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Using Xcode, in your ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"project package dependencies","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", add a new ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"dependency"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Search with the GitHub repository URL (https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios), and select the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"ouds-ios","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" dependency."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can then choose the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"dependency rule"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" you want."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To know which version you need, you can have a look on the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/01-%E2%80%90-Available-API"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and also the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/releases"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Let’s say you will use some beta version today, e.g. the version 3.0.0-beta.8"}]}],"runtimePreview":null,"caption":[],"type":"step"},{"code":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-1-ouds-libraries.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you downloaded the package, you will see several librairies are available."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They can be embeded inside your "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"target"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" librairies."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Things are separated to let users integrate only what they need and embed the abre minimum of content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesContract"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" library provides the main elements like the "},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The theme contract is defined inside it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesOrange"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesSosh"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" provides the theme implementation for the Sosh products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesWireframe"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" provides the theme implementation for the Wireframe theme, which is a theme dedicated to mockups and prototypes."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesOrangeCompact"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products but with constraints of sizes and spaces."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSComponents"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" contains the SwiftUI OUDS components defined with the Figma specifications, and also useful view modifers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensRaw"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensSemantic"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensComponents"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" are librairies defining and providing the tokens for low level (raw),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"middle level (semantic) or component levels (high level)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSModules"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" is for modules or rich components with extra logic."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSFoundations"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" is dedicated to some utilities and shared logic."}]}],"runtimePreview":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add for example only the umbrella product merging all products mentioned above: "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUI"}],"type":"emphasis"}]}],"type":"step"}]}]},{"assessments":[{"title":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which of these choices is correct?"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[],"choices":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"I can contribute to OUDS using pull request"}]}],"isCorrect":true,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is open source, under MIT license, and hosted on GitHub. Of course you can contribute!"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS supports officialy all Apple OS like visionOS, tvOS, watchOS, iPadOS, iOS and also CarPlay."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The main supported targets are iOS \/ iPadOS. However we do our best to support macOS, visionOS, tvOS and watchOS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"CarPlay specific cases are not scoped yet."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS provides UIKit components"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS supports only SwiftUI."}]}]}],"type":"multiple-choice"},{"title":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which imports of the OUDS Swift Package products can I choose?"}]}],"content":[],"choices":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Some of the available products depending to my needs, or only ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwiftUI"},{"text":" if I am very lazy and don’t care about my app size.","type":"text"}]}],"isCorrect":true,"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can import all products provided by the Swift Package, and tailor your choice to keep only the ones needed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Even if we recommend to choose only the atomic products you need, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" product wraps all of them."}]}]},{"isCorrect":false,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"None, only the Swift package dependency matter."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You need to chose the products the Swift package provides.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"multiple-choice"}],"anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessments"},{"title":"Instanciate and inject a theme","featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial","abstract":[{"text":"The theme is exposed as one object which will be injected inside your SwiftUI view.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The theme provides all tokens which defines in the end the rendering of everything.","type":"text"}],"action":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Get started","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Get started","type":"text"}],"type":"reference"},"kind":"callToAction"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies"},"metadata":{"title":"Swift Package integration","category":"Orange Unified Design System","role":"project","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)"},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS":{"url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/use-of-first-components-provided-by-ouds","type":"topic","role":"article","identifier"